Body:
@rversteegen After disabling automatic compaction, you might be able to use up to 1M, and the copilot server doesn't seem to have a limit. However, it's better to manually compact at 200k, otherwise you might violate the copilot agreement. Currently, the Claude agent inside GitHub Copilot can use up to 200K.Copilot limits the first prompt to no more than 128k, but the context length seems to have no limit; the v1/models API returns 200k. 

